menu "Agentic Kit"

    config AGENTIC_KIT_ENABLE_LAN
        bool "Enable Tuya LAN 3.5"
        default n
        help
            Build the optional Tuya LAN 3.5 service and socket PAL extension
            for local discovery and DP control. The application must initialize
            and process the LAN service explicitly after the network is ready.
            When disabled, LAN sources and include paths are excluded from
            the Agentic Kit component.

endmenu
